    "content": "<p><strong>Don't watch the clock;</strong> do what it does. <em>Keep going.</em></p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "empowering",
    "authorId": ""
  },
  {
    "content": "<p><strong>Success is not final,</strong> failure is not fatal:</p><p><em>It is the courage to continue that counts.</em></p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "reflective",
    "authorId": ""
  },
  {
    "content": "<p><strong>Your limitation</strong> — <em>it’s only your imagination.</em></p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "uplifting",
    "authorId": ""
  },
  {
    "content": "<p><em>Push yourself,</em> because no one else is going to do it for you.</p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "empowering",
    "authorId": ""
  },
  {
    "content": "<p><strong>Great things</strong> never come from <em>comfort zones.</em></p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "empowering",
    "authorId": ""
  },
  {
    "content": "<p><strong>Wake up with determination.</strong></p><p><em>Go to bed with satisfaction.</em></p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "energetic",
    "authorId": ""
  },
  {
    "content": "<p><strong>Dream it.</strong> Wish it. <em>Do it.</em></p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "empowering",
    "authorId": ""
  },
  {
    "content": "<p>The harder you work for something,</p><p><em>the greater you’ll feel when you achieve it.</em></p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "uplifting",
    "authorId": ""
  },
  {
    "content": "<p><strong>Don’t stop when you’re tired.</strong></p><p><em>Stop when you’re done.</em></p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "energetic",
    "authorId": ""
  },
  {
    "content": "<p><em>Little by little,</em> a little becomes a lot.</p>",
    "mood": "motivated",
    "tone": "calming",
    "authorId": ""
  }
